        "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | Age | Adoption | Passing | Confidence |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [valaxy](https://valaxy.site) ([source](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun/valaxy)) | [`^0.22.5` -> `^0.22.6`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/valaxy/0.22.5/0.22.6) | [![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/valaxy/0.22.6?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![adoption](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/adoption/npm/valaxy/0.22.6?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![passing](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/compatibility/npm/valaxy/0.22.5/0.22.6?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/valaxy/0.22.5/0.22.6?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>YunYouJun/valaxy (valaxy)</summary>\n\n### [`v0.22.6`](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun/valaxy/releases/tag/v0.22.6)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun/valaxy/compare/v0.22.5...v0.22.6)\n\n#####    🚀 Features\n\n-   **theme-yun**: Optimize local search styles  -  by [@&#8203;YunYouJun](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun) [<samp>(017b7)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun/valaxy/commit/017b7ad6)\n\n#####    🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n-   Locales array merge by override  -  by [@&#8203;YunYouJun](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun) [<samp>(992c6)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun/valaxy/commit/992c6c2b)\n-   Md time warning locale & add test  -  by [@&#8203;YunYouJun](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun) [<samp>(2d94e)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun/valaxy/commit/2d94ef97)\n-   **theme-press**: Override git-contributor list styles  -  by [@&#8203;YunYouJun](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun) [<samp>(34b4f)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun/valaxy/commit/34b4f9f1)\n-   **theme-yun**: Search btn hover color  -  by [@&#8203;YunYouJun](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun) [<samp>(bc214)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun/valaxy/commit/bc21428b)\n\n#####     [View changes on GitHub](https://redirect.github.com/YunYouJun/valaxy/compare/v0.22.5...v0.22.6)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: Branch creation - At any time (no schedule defined), Automerge - At any time (no schedule defined).\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/). View the [repository job log](https://developer.mend.io/github/WRXinYue/wrxinyue.org).\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiIzOS44NS4wIiwidXBkYXRlZEluVmVyIjoiMzkuODUuMCIsInRhcmdldEJyYW5jaCI6Im1haW4iLCJsYWJlbHMiOltdfQ==-->\n",
