        "updated_at": "2025-01-01T15:13:23Z",
        "author_association": "NONE",
        "body": "Thank you so much, really great work!\r\nI am running ZWAVE-JS-UI on a Windows 11 PC with Aeotec ZStick Gen 7 attached. Cloned the content\r\nfrom my old (production) stick Gen 5 which also worked without issues. \r\nWith your Binding as a .jar file I could install the binding:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7e234dd-f2b7-49fc-b22d-9e509f514bf1)\r\nAlso had first nodes added as things:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67df9575-1619-47d7-a0c2-2b3b4d2ac03f)\r\nOnly problem I am facing now is that thing (node) configuration is not read from z-wave-js-ui server,\r\nis this work-in-progress or do I miss anything?\r\nAgain, thanx for your work, it's leveraging OH with this great Z-Wave implementation\r\n\r\n\r\n",
