=\"https://github.com/kubernetes/code-generator/commit/5f8887b4a906c13c6632f5fe0ef7f6771cde5b64\"><code>5f8887b</code></a> Update dependencies to v0.30.8 tag</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/kubernetes/code-generator/commit/304c1999892b41b6a3ff5dae260253f39cf53660\"><code>304c199</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes/code-generator/issues/126984\">#126984</a> from dashpole/fix_mem_leak_30</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/kubernetes/code-generator/commit/d0ac54713ee04bf4c730cf41346f93c7ee721254\"><code>d0ac547</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes/code-generator/issues/127307\">#127307</a><code>dims/automated-cherry-pick-of-#126353</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/kubernetes/code-generator/commit/3050aab142634a217547e9cdff7d17650613784f\"><code>3050aab</code></a> run update-vendor.sh and fix up broken go.sum(s)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/kubernetes/code-generator/commit/a0d26b74f43a71e26dfbc3b738c03992e621b3b3\"><code>a0d26b7</code></a> update vendor</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/kubernetes/code-generator/compare/v0.30.5...v0.30.8\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `sigs.k8s.io/controller-tools` from 0.14.0 to 0.17.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/releases\">sigs.k8s.io/controller-tools's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v0.17.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>🐛 Fix duplicate default value when generating CRDs with corev1.Protocol by <a href=\"https://github.com/sbueringer\"><code>@​sbueringer</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1035\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1035</a></li>\n<li>🐛 rbac: fix adding nonResourceURLs including normalisation by <a href=\"https://github.com/chrischdi\"><code>@​chrischdi</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1044\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1044</a></li>\n<li>🐛 rbac: fix deduplication of core group and add test coverage by <a href=\"https://github.com/chrischdi\"><code>@​chrischdi</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1045\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1045</a></li>\n<li>:bug: Allow CLI binaries to set a version by <a href=\"https://github.com/josvazg\"><code>@​josvazg</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1049\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1049</a></li>\n<li>✨ Allow customizing generated webhook configuration's name by <a href=\"https://github.com/davidxia\"><code>@​davidxia</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1002\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1002</a></li>\n<li>🐛 pkg/crd: fix type casting panic with new default <code>*types.Alias</code> with Go 1.23 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mtardy\"><code>@​mtardy</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1061\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1061</a></li>\n<li>:sparkles: Add selectablefield marker by <a href=\"https://github.com/everesio\"><code>@​everesio</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1050\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1050</a></li>\n<li>🐛 pkg/crd: fix a missed type casting panic with new *types.Alias by <a href=\"https://github.com/mtardy\"><code>@​mtardy</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1079\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1079</a></li>\n<li>🐛 pkg/crd: support validation on type alias to basic types by <a href=\"https://github.com/mtardy\"><code>@​mtardy</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1078\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1078</a></li>\n<li>🐛 Fix item validation for unhashable markers by <a href=\"https://github.com/sbueringer\"><code>@​sbueringer</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1080\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1080</a></li>\n<li>:bug: Handling Identical Kubebuilder Annotations in Different CRs with * Verbs by <a href=\"https://github.com/OdedViner\"><code>@​OdedViner</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1081\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1081</a></li>\n<li>:warning: Add support for encoding.TextMarshaler by <a href=\"https://github.com/twz123\"><code>@​twz123</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1015\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1015</a></li>\n<li>:sparkles: Handle word boundaries and add ellipsis for <code>MaxDescLen</code> by <a href=\"https://github.com/dhaiducek\"><code>@​dhaiducek</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1006\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1006</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Misc</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>🏃 Rename default branch to main by <a href=\"https://github.com/sbueringer\"><code>@​sbueringer</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1038\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1038</a></li>\n<li>🏃 Verify PR titles with shell script by <a href=\"https://github.com/sbueringer\"><code>@​sbueringer</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1057\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1057</a></li>\n<li>📖 github: update PR template by <a href=\"https://github.com/chrischdi\"><code>@​chrischdi</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/pull/1060\">kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools#1060</a></li>\n<li>🌱 OWNERS: Promote chrischdi to reviewer by <a href=\"https://github.com/chrischdi\"><code>@​chrischdi</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/kub